      "statement": "The registry advertises exactly three required scopes (openid, groups, and the Dex cross-client audience scope audience:server:client_id:<public URL>) via required_scopes, and build_server passes them as AuthSettings.required_scopes so the RFC 9728 metadata lists them.",
