    },
    {
      "id": "claim_8c466a91b2434698aaff5bd43c059ad1",
      "statement": "Scopes are never checked from the token: a valid token is granted the full required scope list unconditionally, because Dex tokens carry no scope claim; authorization is decided separately by group membership.",
